&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;translate them into technical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Conduct product demonstrations, proof-of-concept (POC) deployments, and solution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;presentations for customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Design and implement security solutions, including MDM, RMM, and Patch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Management tools, based on customer needs and business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Provide technical guidance and advice to clients during the presales cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Assist in creating and customizing proposals, responses to RFPs, and technical&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Work closely with customers and internal teams to ensure successful deployments,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;configurations, and implementations of cybersecurity products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues during presales and post-sales phases.&lt;/p&gt;
