&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementation Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Hexnode&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hexnode is a &lt;strong&gt;global leader in Unified Endpoint Management (UEM)&lt;/strong&gt;, trusted by over 100 countries and managing millions of devices worldwide. With a rapid pace of innovation, we have established ourselves as a dominant force across Apple, Windows, Android, macOS, Linux, and tvOS. Fuelling the transformation to a seamless ecosystem of connected tools, Hexnode is revolutionizing the enterprise software and cybersecurity landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high-caliber &lt;strong&gt;Implementation Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; with a deep understanding of the Cybersecurity landscape. In this role, you will be the technical architect behind our customers&#39; success, ensuring that global organizations can seamlessly deploy and optimize Hexnode’s security solutions. You will act as a strategic consultant, bridging the gap between complex security requirements and technical execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role operates in a global environment and requires the flexibility to work in shifts to support our international clientele.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Solution Design: Partner with sales and technical teams to analyze customer requirements, translating complex business needs into scalable and secure architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative Implementation: Lead the end-to-end deployment of UEM, MDM, RMM, and Patch Management solutions, customized to align with client-specific security policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Advisory: Act as a trusted technical advisor to IT Directors and stakeholders, providing authoritative guidance throughout the onboarding and implementation lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Serve as a feedback loop between customers and our Product/Engineering teams to advocate for feature requests and influence the product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex Troubleshooting: Proactively diagnose and resolve intricate technical challenges encountered during the deployment phase, ensuring a frictionless experience for the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deployment Excellence: Guarantee precise configuration and flawless execution of Hexnode’s cybersecurity suite across diverse IT infrastructures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry Acumen: Maintain an unwavering commitment to staying ahead of cybersecurity trends, emerging threats, and advancements in endpoint management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Centricity: Elevate customer satisfaction (CSAT) by ensuring every implementation is timely, efficient, and delivers immediate value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will collaborate with Presales, Sales and partners to analyse and help with the deployment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–7 years of proven experience in Technical Implementation, Onboarding, or Solutions Architecture with a focus on UEM, MDM, or RMM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on expertise in deploying and configuring leading solutions such as &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Intune, VMware Workspace ONE, Jamf, or Ivanti&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of modern security protocols, Zero Trust frameworks, and best practices for remote monitoring and patching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical capabilities in understanding customer environment, Active directory, cloud idps, network solutions, different Operating Systems, Security solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to define and execute implementation plan based on customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid foundational knowledge of network security (VPN, Proxy, Firewall), endpoint protection, and cloud-integrated IT environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with RMM and Patch Management platforms like Kaseya, ConnectWise, or NinjaRMM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional ability to manage customer expectations, identify technical blockers, and solve complex problems under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to articulate technical concepts clearly to both engineering teams and non-technical business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BE/B.Tech or MCA in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills (Good to Have)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with advanced network security methodologies and enterprise endpoint management strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud-native security concepts, architectures (AWS/Azure/GCP), and associated technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hexnode is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We welcome and encourage candidates of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences to apply.&lt;/p&gt;

