&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–10 years of proven experience in Presales, Solutions Architecture, or Technical Consulting, with a focus on UEM, MDM, or RMM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical understanding of enterprise-grade security and device management for global organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
