&lt;li&gt;Advanced aptitude for managing customer expectations, rapidly identifying technical &quot;blockers,&quot; and negotiating solutions that align client needs with Hexnode’s capabilities. Exceptional public speaking and presentation skills, with a track record of delivering compelling technical pitches to large enterprise audiences and diverse groups of stakeholders in high-pressure environments.&lt;/li&gt;
