&lt;li&gt;A robust understanding of network security principles (VPN, Proxy, Firewall), Zero Trust frameworks, endpoint protection strategies, and overarching cloud-integrated IT infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, Information Technology, or a closely related technical field (preferred). BE/B-Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
