&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1658&quot; data-end=&quot;2184&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Minimum&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;hands-on experience as Jira Administrator.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong expertise with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jira Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(configuration, customization, automation).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience supporting Agile/DevOps teams (Scrum, Kanban frameworks).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of Jira post-migration support and troubleshooting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Understanding of integrations with Confluence, Bitbucket, or similar tools.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical, communication, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to independently manage priorities and deliver results in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/div&gt;
